# Full repacked game archives (100+ MB, contain the entire copyrighted
# H3bitmap.lod / H3sprite.lod / H3ab_bmp.lod / H3ab_spr.lod game data,
# not just the translated resources) - build locally with 004 scripts,
# do not commit/push to a public repo.
004_HOMM3_complete/
006_EASY_INSTALL/gog_complete/Data/
006_EASY_INSTALL/gog_complete/Maps/

# Campaign intro/mission cutscenes + voiceover, converted from the game's
# own copyrighted assets (VIDEO.VID / H3ab_ahd.vid / Heroes3.snd) -
# regenerate with 002_TOOLS/scripts/004_extract_campaign_videos.py +
# 014_organize_mission_media.py, don't push to a public repo. Never commit
# these - even if asked to "just commit everything" - this is the user's
# call to make, not an agent's; see memory
# homm3-never-commit-game-video-audio. Blanket-matched by extension at ANY
# depth under 005_RAW (rather than a specific folder shape) since that
# shape has already changed twice as this got reorganized - .mp4/.wav
# under 005_RAW are never anything BUT extracted game video/audio, so this
# is safe and won't need updating the next time the layout changes again.
005_RAW/**/*.mp4
005_RAW/**/*.wav

# Python bytecode cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Test archives produced by mp4_to_bik_inject.py (full copies of copyrighted
# game archives with one clip swapped, used for in-game verification only)
002_TOOLS/scripts/*.VID
002_TOOLS/scripts/*.LOD
002_TOOLS/scripts/*.SND
